      "problem": "Calculate \n${\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\u27e85,\\,-1,\\,2\u27e9$\nand\n${\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\u27e8-2,\\,-4,\\,3\u27e9.$",
